  "questions": {
    "agg": "Which suppliers meet both of these conditions? (1) The supplier's stock of contract grain fell by more than {t1} from the earlier of its two dated stock counts to the later one (a document may call a count a stocktake or an inventory check). (2) The supplier's full delivery route is longer than {t2}, counting the road leg to the county weighbridge plus the stretch from the weighbridge to its loading bay along its private lane (or access track, or farm track).",
    "join": "Exactly one supplier's stock of contract grain fell by more than {t1} from the earlier of its two dated stock counts to the later one (a document may call a count a stocktake or an inventory check). Which warehouse has a full delivery route exactly as long as that supplier's, counting for each the road leg to the county weighbridge plus the stretch from the weighbridge to the loading bay along its private lane (or access track, or farm track)? Answer with the supplier and then the warehouse."
  }
